  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 76329f96a0bd36043946dd720240c25c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mid-Prologue 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data:
    convoName: MidPrologue 2
    speakers:
    - Caladria
    - Shigora
    - Nova Point
    - Oblivion
    lines:
    - character: Shigora
      expression: 
      line: Centuries later, there came to be a feudal society named Shigora. Shigora
        was fueled by the magic of the Kanazawa clan, and they lived in an unstable
        balance. The Kanazawa were far from benevolent rulers, but they kept the
        peace enough.
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Shigora
      expression: 
      line: Scheming for more efficient methods of gaining time, Orion waited for
        the clan's most powerful summoner, Noboru, to turn his back before slaughtering
        the rest of the clan. To incur Noboru's wrath, he planted evidence to craft
        the illusion of an uprising by the citizens. Upon discovering the evidence,
        Noboru fell for the trap and, enraged, summoned swarms of yokai to genocide
        the citizens of Shigora.
      audio: {fileID: 0}
